WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.860
the reason why you hold that graveyard dear

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.360
and are covered in scars...

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:10.950
Was it because you are Queen Mary?

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.240
Judge.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.160
I killed 300 people in an attempt

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.500
to make England Catholic once more.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.540
I am the sinner, Mary Tudor.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:24.050
I told you that Queen Catherine was unable to give birth to Mary.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:31.390
Instead, the Fairy Queen birthed by Anne Boleyn had a twin sister.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:33.010
I am the older daughter,

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.890
who not only lacks even half of the Fairy Queen's powers,

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:37.810
but is also named Mary Stuart,

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:41.650
the one destined to be executed.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.620
the Fairy Queen Elizabeth.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:23.830
Judge.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:33.930
Master Scar—

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.640
If possible, I didn't want you to find out.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.230
Master Scarred...

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.560
I must enter the Tower of London now

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.480
to prepare for the historical reenactment.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.690
But, Musashi will have left England

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:54.570
by the time the execution's over.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.580
Master Tenzo, let's play that game.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:08.460
<i>I-I would truly love to lose to her,</i>

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:12.130
<i>but I can't get mixed up with someone like her more than I already have!</i>

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:17.760
Queen Mary, will you continue to be Master Scarred when all is said and done?

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.600
Judge! I'll be fine.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.520
I won't disappear without a trace.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.940
Ultimately, Mary will be saved.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.270
Is that right?

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.770
I lost, didn't I?

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.610
Judge. Take care.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:35.650
Judge. May we meet again...

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.530
Oh, right! Master Scarred,

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:39.870
do you like any particular type of guy?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:42.830
I couldn't say.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.910
But if I fell for someone,

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:51.210
I would like to be the type of woman who can give him a scar that lasts a lifetime.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.130
May I heal it for you?

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.350
<i>She has completely cut her ties with me, hasn't she?</i>

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:02.810
Master Tenzo.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.480
I had a good time.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:09.060
I am happy that I got to have so much fun with you.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.980
Judge. I'm glad to hear it.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:12.650
Goodbye.

00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:18.740
N-No!

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:19.360
Huh?

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.660
Don't let her go!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.620
She won't be saved!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.200
It's the same as Horizon's execution!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.250
This facility is bad news!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:32.460
It has been modified to work like the execution grounds we saw in Mikawa!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:36.710
"Mary's proud spirit will forever be with England."

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.300
Tell him what that means.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.220
As the Vice Chancellor, I grant you permission to tell him.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:46.470
1st Special Agent, Queen Mary is going to be executed.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.140
Her getting saved is a lie!

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:51.020
The execution grounds will disintegrate her

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.150
and use her to strengthen Excalibur Caliburn.

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.150
Queen Mary's salvation

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.530
is to be forever merged with this country's Earth Pulse

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.200
and become a force that protects this land.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.280
Th-Then does that mean

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:06.040
she's truly going to be executed?!

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.210
When did she resolve herself to such a fate?

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:30.350
Toss him aside.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:33.350
He has nothing to do with Double Bloody Mary.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.980
Doesn't that imply he means nothing to you, Walter?

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.360
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.530
How horrible!

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:49.000
Tenzo died in such an uneventful manner!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.500
No, take a closer look!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:52.460
He's twitching like a bug.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:55.170
Hey, Walter! No, I should say Yamanaka!

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:58.630
You would send Queen Mary to her grave?!

00:05:58.630 --> 00:05:59.760
Milton!

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:03.010
I have a seat reserved just for you.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.760
Don't patronize me!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.100
I, Milton the Great,

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:09.720
will not take part in a plot to protect England

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.480
at the cost of a noble spirit!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.230
Very well, then. The fun and games are over.

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:15.980
Listen well!

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:19.320
Tonight we will hold the true festival at Oxford.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:22.240
One that will determine England and Musashi's bearing.

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.660
But what will be decided at tonight's party?

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.450
Your "entertainment" allowed England

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.950
to offer the Testament Union the excuse,

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.620
"We were taking measures to secure Musashi".

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:38.960
It also allowed Musashi to show that our military prowess is on par with England.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.920
Those duels were of value to both sides.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:45.050
But that is problematic for England.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.930
Tes.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:49.060
By proving that Musashi is as powerful as England,

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:51.140
it has become a threat to the other nations.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:54.940
As such, England cannot allow Musashi to leave port

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.690
and will take custody over the vessel.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:57.900
What are you saying?

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:01.400
Such issues fall under Masazumi's territory.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.650
Listen to me, Foolish Brother.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:07.780
but be prepared for anything.

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.120
Sis, is Nate that bad off?

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.290
Judge. She definitely isn't doing well.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:17.080
But in a way, Mitotsudaira was prepared for something like this to happen,

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:19.670
so don't throw out some weird response.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:21.050
You got that?

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:22.000
Look!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.130
You see that, Foolish Brother?

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:31.560
Poor Mitotsudaira's boobies got shaved down to practically nothing and now she's super flat!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.480
What is wrong with you?! I was in the middle of changing!

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:45.700
I came to check up on you before you could hide your injuries.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.370
Nate, you sure fought hard!

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.750
Since you're a werewolf-type, you couldn't use your silver chains once your nails broke, right?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.170
I'll fortify them for you.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:05.260
It is thanks to you, Mitotsudaira,

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:08.090
that Tori and I were able to have a talk.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.800
I didn't do much...

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.600
Toes too?

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.680
Only tacky women have mismatched nails.

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:29.240
He's really here.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:33.080
Sir, why does the Chancellor always visit

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.910
this town filled with half elves?

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.960
The general has been coming here to play baseball for ages.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:40.830
You know about the Battle of Lepanto, don't you?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:45.920
It was a dual war with the Far East's Battle of Itsukushima.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.550
The half elves were the ones who served as our shields in the front lines,

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:54.430
oared the galleys and died without accomplishing anything.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:58.060
Half elves age at the same pace as humans,

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:01.400
but their mental development can't keep up,

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.770
so they act inappropriately for their age.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:08.780
As such, they're oppressed and sent to the most dangerous zones when war breaks out.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:13.780
But a great many of the half elves were led safely through Lepanto.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.330
An unknown commander happened to be there.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:18.330
Could he have been the one...?

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:21.710
That's the story behind the guys here.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:25.170
And even now, the general comes to see them.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.470
You look great in that.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:32.840
You really do!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.260
Is this what Aoi picked out for me?

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.180
It certainly matches my style.

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:38.600
Just a sec!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.270
This is...

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:47.860
This is the hilt to the missing Lypē Katarripsi.

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:50.820
Goodness, Masazumi. What type of illusion did you make?

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:52.450
I didn't make it!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:01.830
Come to think of it, didn't you pull out an apple when you came to see me?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:06.590
I imagine she's created a different plane for storage purposes.

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:11.090
I'm thinking Horizon was sleeping a lot lately because

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:14.890
she was installing this ability and then rebooting.

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:15.970
Yeah.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:19.850
She also partook in the chat when there was that meeting with Lord Howard.

00:10:19.850 --> 00:10:22.730
I thought she had formed a contract somewhere,

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.900
but she must have installed that as well.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.360
Think this thing has a lid?

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:29.820
Will it be okay in the water when she takes a bath?

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:32.820
Judge. Everyone, please behold.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.990
This is a bowl filled with a big serving of seaweed.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.750
Long black hair and a flat chest...

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:45.290
That is Musashi's Vice President!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.000
Please accept this as a sign of our meeting.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:50.920
Huh?

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.920
Isn't that...?

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:54.930
Masazumi, do you recognize her?

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:55.510
Yes.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.390
No, that's...

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:03.230
Where is Musashi's Chancellor and President?

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:05.810
Darn it, Aoi! What's keeping you?

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:09.270
Oh, my! Foolish Brother,

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.610
why are you wearing Masazumi's dress?

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:14.110
Aw, man! Sis, don't let the cat outta the bag!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:16.700
Things were just starting to get interesting.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.450
I knew it.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:23.790
Musashi's representative is a pervert?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.220
"Save you from anything."

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.760
Was I able to accomplish anything

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:41.600
aside from reenacting history?

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:56.610
En-England and the Far East shall hereby hold a meeting between academies.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:12:00.030
Then allow me to introduce myself anew.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.200
I am the Vice President of Musashi Ariadust Academy,

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.950
Honda Masazumi.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.960
As our clerk is absent today,

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.960
this priestess from the Asama Shrine will serve as his substitute.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:12.670
Testament.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.590
<i>Oh, Lady, you rock!</i>

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:16.630
<i>Your vowels were lustrous!</i>

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:17.630
<i>LUSTrous, LUSTrous!</i>

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.300
<i>You seem most enthused.</i>

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:23.140
<i>Heighten your enthusiasm and share it with me.</i>

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.890
<i>Walter actually wrote something!</i>

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.310
Tell me, what are your demands?

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:30.900
Tes. They are essentially one and the same.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.940
After all, it all ties into whether or not

00:12:33.940 --> 00:12:36.280
I will authorize Musashi to leave port.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:37.650
Judge.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.320
Musashi is acting as an independent nation

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.160
as it gathers the Armaments of Deadly Sins

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:45.120
and works to prevent the apocalypse.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.420
Musashi's aims will prove beneficial to all countries.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:50.870
As such, we would like permission

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.380
for Musashi to leave your port.

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:53.630
I won't allow that.

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:56.760
Your aims impede England's will.

00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:59.050
If you allow history to play its course,

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.510
things will naturally pan out in the Peace of Westphalia.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.640
In which case, why not have the countries

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.520
bring their Armaments to the conference?

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:10.060
If you retrieve the Armament of Deadly Sins before then,

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.400
the international power balance will crumble.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:13.270
There is a distinct possibility

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.520
that it will create a lapse in recreating history.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:18.490
<i>She's totally right! This pisses me off!</i>

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:22.490
<i>"Uh, I'm pretty sure that's what bad guys say."</i>

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:26.580
But Musashi cannot take advantage of such kindness.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:31.250
Since the Mikawa Conflict, the Far East has made Princess Horizon their sovereign

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.790
and claims to be an independent country with sovereignty.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:37.130
However, the emotions belonging to said sovereign, Horizon Ariadust,

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:41.180
are being used as material components in the Armament of Deadly Sins.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:45.930
As such, reclaiming the Armaments is meant to make our sovereign whole.

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:51.690
Thus we cannot consent to the concept of waiting for everyone to bring them to the Peace of Westphalia.

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:56.190
We shall recover the Armaments, establish our sovereignty,

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:59.190
and obtain equal standing with other nations by preventing the apocalypse.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.700
That is what we will accomplish at Westphalia.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:06.370
Does this mean the Far East intends to overturn the Testament Union's provisional rule

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.910
and reclaim domination over the Divine States?

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:14.920
It seems you have forgotten about the Harmonic Unification War.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.800
The wench!

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.520
I could never say something like that.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:32.270
What do you have to say, Vice President of Musashi?

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:33.520
Judge.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:37.110
The Far East will not resign itself to remaining under provisional rule any longer.

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:41.440
That would be because our leader has already made his mind.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:45.360
He wants to see who out there is the strongest.

00:14:45.990 --> 00:14:48.030
She just declared war against the entire world?!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:49.990
Now she's done it!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:55.420
All academies possess an academy conflict system.

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:59.380
Musashi simply never used it while under provisional rule.

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:01.000
And let me put this out there.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.930
The right to battle is composed of the right to declare war and the right to wage war.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:07.930
Until Musashi recovers all of the Armaments of Deadly Sins,

00:15:07.930 --> 00:15:09.890
we will seal the right to declare war.

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:15.020
Furthermore, Musashi has made provisions to form alliances

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:20.520
with any academies or nations that return the Armaments or do not already possess one.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.650
In other words, we will become allies with any nation

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.150
that either returns their Armament of Deadly Sins or lacks one.

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:29.910
This means that Musashi will personally
compensate for the upset power balance.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:34.200
Fairy Queen, we would like to have Oxford Academy of England

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.330
be the first to join this alliance.

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.290
I refuse.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.460
<i>You're turning the offer down?</i>

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.130
I will admit that alliance sounds quite tempting.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:53.720
But you can fly freely and possess a powerful stealth system, making Musashi dangerous.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:16:00.610
If Musashi were to attain sovereignty and tried to force the other nations out of the Far East,

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:06.240
we would commence an all-out attack against Musashi and annihilate you here and now.

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.860
Get into position, gentlemen.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:11.580
Wait, guys!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.620
England's main fleet lacks the power to effectively attack Musashi.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:19.330
Right now Sir Drake and their main forces

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.840
should be surveying Tres España's forces.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.260
What was that?!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.510
This is your doing, isn't it?!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.220
Yeah. I had Musashi enter standby for take off.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.720
The IZUMO-manufactured surface ether driver,

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.230
hull-oriented Special #0-6 Susashizunami,

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:40.060
is being activated. Over.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:45.730
Musashi still has enough fuel to last for three days with normal sailing.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.360
Hexagone Francaise's IZUMO is only two days away.

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:51.700
Even if England had its main fleet return,

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:53.240
they wouldn't make it in time.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.370
If you refuse to form an alliance with us,

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.750
Musashi will merely hold similar negotiations with other nations.

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:00.960
Such insolence!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:03.250
You are blithe fools who will vanish from history!

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.340
Get down!

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.420
That's...

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.840
Proof that she is the Fairy Queen!

00:17:15.890 --> 00:17:19.980
You haven't forgotten who I am, have you?

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:23.190
England has the Excalibur Caliburn.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:27.190
Furthermore, we can have our ally Holland move to intercept you,

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:32.030
request that Tres España put reenacting history on hold for a time,

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.490
and request assistance from the Testament Union nations.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.910
It is fully possible for us to sink Musashi.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.120
Your Majesty,

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:42.370
I have purchased one of Holland's aerial fleets.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.380
Tes.

00:17:43.380 --> 00:17:47.550
Howard, you've made up for how they humiliated you during those negotiations.

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.920
Lady Masazumi,

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:53.640
an unidentified fleet is currently approaching from the southeast.

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:54.760
Over.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.760
You're surrounded, Musashi.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.220
What now?

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:04.900
Well, Vice President of Musashi?

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:09.400
Fairy Queen, Musashi does not wish for hostilities with England.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.490
England should feel the same.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.610
Absurd!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.950
It would only disgrace us if I made that request to the other nations in jest.

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.910
I imagine you were being serious with those countries.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:25.040
But even if England allowed other countries to sink Musashi,

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.670
you could not personally sink us.

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:32.130
Because England wishes to relinquish

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:34.380
the "acclamation of having sunken Musashi" to another country.

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.590
What?

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:40.350
Really, England should have been the one to say that to the other nations.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:45.440
By saying it themselves, Musashi has put England deep in their debt.

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:50.150
Is that because the countries that respond to England's summon for help

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.690
might question why England is willing to relinquish that honor?

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.990
Uh-huh.

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:56.990
In all actuality, England would have reserved their forces

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.160
and not participated in the attack.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.830
I perceive that there is a reason why England

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:03.910
cannot attack Musashi.

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:07.670
First, there is England's fleet.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:11.300
Your newly built fleet is still allied with Holland

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:13.720
and your currently active fleet is conducting surveillance.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.930
Even if you had them return right now, they would not make it in time.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:18.220
As for your land forces,

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.760
are your defenses here perfect?

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.350
In preparation for the Spanish Armada,

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.440
your land forces are currently spread across your shores.

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:30.440
Wouldn't that make London your least fortified area?

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:34.950
Going by the footsteps, you are only about 500-strong.

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:39.530
The Trumps aside, I alone could take on such numbers.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.540
And Your Majesty,

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:45.250
you said that you have Excalibur Caliburn,

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:49.540
but if you used it now, wouldn't it obstruct Mary's execution?

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.760
Executing Mary with Excalibur Caliburn

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.340
is vital for recreating England's history.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.590
If you were forced to play your hand and use it,

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.510
it would probably interfere with your reenactment.

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.970
Wouldn't avoiding that

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:08.100
prove to be the wisest decision for England in the long run?

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:10.060
Are you trying to admonish me?

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:14.820
All because of the Spanish Armada battle in one week's time,

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:16.780
Musashi will not attack England.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:21.990
This is only natural for England and something everyone is already aware of,

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.290
Your Majesty.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.000
<i>Most impressive, Masazumi!</i>

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:29.250
<i>By claiming that everything we do is for replicating history,</i>

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.750
<i>you've made it easier for England to assent.</i>

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:38.510
<i>This woman is truly getting on my nerves.</i>

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:41.800
<i>But she seems to have a good grasp on England's current situation.</i>

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:45.060
Save you from anything...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.140
I have something to ask before I come to an all-encompassing decision.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:53.980
Your naïve ideas will throw other countries into chaos.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:57.030
You tell me to accept that and form an alliance with you,

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:58.570
but what would we gain from doing so?

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.860
Judge.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:03.330
Musashi would make England its base of commerce.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.160
Musashi would like to help

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:08.160
strengthen England via trade.

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.370
<i>Now I see.</i>

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:15.340
<i>Such commerce would preserve their own domestic affairs via exportation.</i>

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.630
<i>If you factor in our victory over the Armada</i>

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:20.840
<i>and our influence at the Peace of Westphalia,</i>

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.930
<i>we could stand above the other nations.</i>

00:21:22.930 --> 00:21:26.390
<i>Before the commerce profits equalize out between nations,</i>

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.730
<i>we could pioneer into the New World</i>

00:21:28.730 --> 00:21:31.600
<i>so we don't have to stay in the Far East.</i>

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.150
I see.

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:37.070
Form an alliance, Fairy Queen!

00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:39.070
We're going to ourselves.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:43.030
That after all your antagonistic maneuvers against Musashi?

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:47.910
Fairy Queen, the provisional rule that Musashi is casting aside

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.910
was not originally part of this planet's history.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.500
Musashi therefore wishes to figure out the apocalypse

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.040
and put the world back on the path of replicating history accurately.

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:57.750
To such ends,

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:02.380
is England willing to be the country that takes the first step to the correct world and trudge forward,

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:04.430
O' Fairy Queen?

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:15.400
Oh, could you wait just a sec?

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:18.280
I am Tres España's 3rd Special Agent,

00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:19.400
Tachibana Gin.

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:22.570
I am the clerk, Velázquez, from the same land.

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:26.950
I'm here to object to this meeting as our ambassador.

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:44.010
It's about time we made our appearance, Macchan.
